  "purpose": "The locked-environment re-run of the 2026-10-11 window on the same host and inputs. The earlier numbers were measured while the interpreter environment did not match requirements.lock (biopython 1.88 / numpy 2.5.4 installed against 1.85 / 2.2.4 locked), a contradiction this repository now gates in CI; here the python arm runs inside a virtualenv installed from the lock. The archive carries code-label.txt: branch, full commit, `git describe --tags --always --dirty` (the short commit hash, because the project has published no release yet), the lock digest, the tree cleanliness and the interpreter versions actually used. Ecosystem-tool arms run in the same session and are archived under tool-arms/.",
